        "nobel_worthiness": "Active matter and flocking revealed how collective motion generates new non-equilibrium states and hydrodynamics, a major unifying advance across living and synthetic matter.",
        "attribution": "Vicsek provided the seminal minimal-model demonstration, while Toner and Ramaswamy developed the decisive continuum and statistical-physics framework.",
