        "nobel_worthiness": "Conformal field theory made critical phenomena in two dimensions tractable through a powerful exact framework, transforming statistical physics and quantum field theory.",
        "attribution": "The credited theorists made defining conceptual and technical contributions to conformal symmetry, operator methods, and exact critical theories.",
