        "nobel_worthiness": "Ab initio molecular dynamics joined electronic structure and atomic motion in a practical, conceptually transparent method that changed computational condensed-matter science.",
        "attribution": "Car and Parrinello are the clear originators of the eponymous method.",
        "maturity": "Its long record of reliable use and subsequent methodological development demonstrates exceptional scientific and practical impact.",
